I walk up the stairs.
I am tired after the gym.
On the second floor, I meet Nina.
She smiles at me.
"Hi Maya," she says.
"Hi Nina, how is it going?" I ask.
"It is going very well," Nina answers.
"You look a little tired."
"Yes, I always work out on Wednesdays," I explain.
"We rarely drink coffee together lately," Nina says.
"Do you have time tomorrow?" she asks.
I think about my Thursday.
"Yes, Thursday is a really good day," I say.
"What time?" I ask.
"Maybe at half past four?"
"Half past four sounds perfect," I answer happily.
"See you tomorrow afternoon," Nina says.
We say goodbye out in the stairwell.
I go into my apartment.
I am looking forward to our coffee date.
